# systemd-sysusers(8) config for Maknae.
# THREE identities by construction (Jackrabbit §4.6 / §9.1; #240a added the third):
#   _maknae        : the daemon service account (primary group _maknae)
#   maknae         : the OPERATOR group — members may connect to the 0660 UDS
#   _maknae-egress : the egress deputy — the ONLY process with a route out. A
#                    separate account so the provider credential is readable by
#                    neither the daemon nor the operator, and so the deputy's
#                    Vault policy can be scoped to the provider-key prefix
#                    alone (ADR-0023 decision 3).
# Both must exist. NO on-disk cross-membership (spec §5.3): _maknae's membership
# in `maknae` exists ONLY at unit scope via the unit's SupplementaryGroups=maknae.
#
# Type Name     ID   GECOS                       Home          Shell
g      maknae   990
u      _maknae  992  "Maknae trust-plane daemon" /nonexistent /usr/sbin/nologin
u      _maknae-egress 991 "Maknae egress deputy"   /nonexistent /usr/sbin/nologin
